{
  "$comment": [
    "The single source for both palettes. Doc 13 §10 names this as the mechanism",
    "that makes visual parity real rather than intended: tools/gen-tokens.mjs emits",
    "web/tokens.css and android/design/Tokens.kt from this file, and",
    "test/tokens.test.js fails if either committed output has drifted from it.",
    "",
    "Neither generated file may be hand-edited. Edit this one and regenerate.",
    "",
    "Dark is the base palette and light is the override, matching the app: doc 04",
    "calls dark the primary and web/app.css defines it on bare :root with light",
    "behind [data-theme]. Recording that the other way round would invert the app's",
    "own default and make every diff read backwards.",
    "",
    "Values are transcribed from web/app.css as it shipped, so this file is a",
    "promotion of what already existed rather than a redesign. Any colour change",
    "should be a separate commit from the mechanism that carries it."
  ],

  "meta": {
    "source": "web/app.css as at 2026-08-24",
    "baseTheme": "dark"
  },

  "color": {
    "bg-canvas":            { "dark": "#0B0E14", "light": "#F8FAFC" },
    "bg-surface":           { "dark": "#121824", "light": "#FFFFFF" },
    "bg-surface-elevated":  { "dark": "#1A2234", "light": "#FFFFFF" },
    "bg-surface-subtle":    { "dark": "#161F2E", "light": "#F1F5F9" },
    "bg-surface-glass":     { "dark": "rgba(18, 24, 36, 0.85)", "light": "rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9)" },

    "border-subtle":        { "dark": "rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08)", "light": "#E2E8F0" },
    "border-prominent":     { "dark": "rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16)", "light": "#CBD5E1" },
    "border-glass":         { "dark": "rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12)", "light": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08)" },

    "text-primary":         { "dark": "#F3F5F9", "light": "#0F172A" },
    "text-secondary":       { "dark": "#94A3B8", "light": "#475569" },
    "text-tertiary":        { "dark": "#64748B", "light": "#94A3B8" },
    "text-accent":          { "dark": "#38BDF8", "light": "#0284C7" },

    "health-pristine":        { "dark": "#10B981", "light": "#059669" },
    "health-pristine-bg":     { "dark": "rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.12)", "light": "#ECFDF5" },
    "health-pristine-border": { "dark": "rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.3)", "light": "rgba(5, 150, 105, 0.25)" },

    "health-good":            { "dark": "#34D399", "light": "#10B981" },
    "health-good-bg":         { "dark": "rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.12)", "light": "#F0FDF4" },
    "health-good-border":     { "dark": "rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.3)", "light": "rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.25)" },

    "health-moderate":        { "dark": "#FBBF24", "light": "#D97706" },
    "health-moderate-bg":     { "dark": "rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.12)", "light": "#FFFBEB" },
    "health-moderate-border": { "dark": "rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.3)", "light": "rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.25)" },

    "health-risk":            { "dark": "#F87171", "light": "#DC2626" },
    "health-risk-bg":         { "dark": "rgba(248, 113, 113, 0.12)", "light": "#FEF2F2" },
    "health-risk-border":     { "dark": "rgba(248, 113, 113, 0.3)", "light": "rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.25)" },

    "brand-cyan":   { "dark": "#06B6D4", "light": "#06B6D4" },
    "$comment-violet": "Darker on white, so the recall card's tint stays legible.",
    "brand-violet": { "dark": "#8B5CF6", "light": "#7C3AED" },
    "brand-blue":   { "dark": "#3B82F6", "light": "#3B82F6" },
    "brand-gold":   { "dark": "#F59E0B", "light": "#F59E0B" },
    "brand-glow":   { "dark": "rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.25)", "light": "rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.25)" }
  },

  "gradient": {
    "brand": { "from": "#06B6D4", "to": "#3B82F6", "angleDeg": 135 }
  },

  "shadow": {
    "sm": {
      "dark": "0 1px 2px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3)",
      "light": "0 1px 3px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06)"
    },
    "md": {
      "dark": "0 4px 12px -2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4), 0 2px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2)",
      "light": "0 4px 12px -2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08)"
    },
    "lg": {
      "dark": "0 10px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5), 0 8px 10px -6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3)",
      "light": "0 10px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1)"
    }
  },

  "radius": {
    "sm": 8,
    "md": 12,
    "lg": 18,
    "pill": 9999
  },

  "layout": {
    "max-app-width": 960,
    "bottom-nav-height": 64,
    "header-height": 56
  },

  "$comment-type": [
    "Doc 04 §2. The scale is why doc 13 §10 requires Inter and JetBrains Mono to",
    "be bundled in the APK: Roboto's metrics do not reproduce it, so an Android",
    "build falling back to the system face is already off-parity before a single",
    "screen is laid out."
  ],
  "type": {
    "display-lg": { "size": 32, "lineHeight": 38, "weight": 700, "tracking": -0.03, "use": "Primary health score number" },
    "title-1":    { "size": 24, "lineHeight": 30, "weight": 600, "tracking": -0.02, "use": "Screen titles, stock price" },
    "title-2":    { "size": 18, "lineHeight": 24, "weight": 600, "tracking": -0.01, "use": "Card headings, section headers" },
    "body-md":    { "size": 15, "lineHeight": 22, "weight": 400, "tracking": 0,     "use": "Primary text, descriptions" },
    "body-sm":    { "size": 13, "lineHeight": 18, "weight": 400, "tracking": 0.01,  "use": "Ratio labels, sub-metrics" },
    "caption":    { "size": 11, "lineHeight": 15, "weight": 500, "tracking": 0.03,  "use": "Badges, pillar tags, timestamps" }
  },

  "font": {
    "sans": {
      "bundled": "Inter",
      "webStack": "-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"SF Pro Display\", \"Inter\", \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif"
    },
    "mono": {
      "bundled": "JetBrains Mono",
      "webStack": "\"SF Mono\", \"JetBrains Mono\", \"Roboto Mono\", monospace"
    }
  }
}
